# Generated artifacts must never be reformatted.
#
# styles/tokens.css is emitted by scripts/build-tokens.js and compared
# byte-for-byte by `npm run check:tokens`. If Prettier rewrites it, the staleness
# gate fails on the next run and `npm run verify` can never pass. Format the
# source (tokens.json) and let the generator own its own output formatting.
styles/tokens.css

# Build output and dependencies.
.next/
out/
build/
node_modules/

# Lockfiles are machine-generated and enormous.
package-lock.json

# Fonts and images are binary.
*.woff2
*.ico
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
